      "Echocardiogram to detect cardiac defects",
      "Skeletal X-rays for scoliosis or other abnormalities"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Deletion of variable size on chromosome 5p detected by karyotyping, FISH, or microarray",
      "Molecular confirmation via array CGH or MLPA"
    ],
